      <activity id="9cccaa11-aec1-5a5f-8371-bad071ef1b76" activityNameId="023765b6-b235-57fe-b217-9954854bb980" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Graphite, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Graphite, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of milled graphite. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
UUID: 80976703-5e65-34a4-94c1-b0e5b5075574
Raw materials, machineries and energy consumption for production, estimated emissions to air from production and infrastructure of the site (approximation). No water emissions.
Location: Data are used here as European average.
Technology: Data approximated with data from lime mining, crushing and milling.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: worldwide 873 kt in 2001
Sampling: approximation with data from literature 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_80976703-5e65-34a4-94c1-b0e5b5075574.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
